Z||000018||Elenor84||10-02-2001||02:22 PM||||U use a 13/16 socket and hammer it on and then turn it and she will go...thats what I did with my 86...<P>------------------<BR>Lance<BR>Click Image to go to site.<BR><A HREF="http://members.nbci.com/_XMCM/lancegspage/Index.html" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Side1.jpg"> </A>||||reg||1
